segments.translation_html:
By the blessing of those who attained the three kayas of the Buddha;
By the blessing of the truth of the unchanging Dharma;
By the blessing of the unshakable harmony of the Sangha;
May all these dedications and aspirations be accomplished.

I bow to you, exalted one, excellent vajra-giver;
I bow to you, who attained the extreme of perfection;
I bow to you, the essence of emptiness;
I bow to you, enlightened Buddha.
